WEBVTT

00:15:59.087 --> 00:16:00.967
and he wasn't doing anything different

00:16:00.991 --> 00:16:03.000
than he had ever done,
1,000 nights before,

00:16:03.024 --> 00:16:04.751
but everything would align.

00:16:04.775 --> 00:16:07.918
And all of a sudden, he would
no longer appear to be merely human.

00:16:07.942 --> 00:16:10.317
He would be lit from within,
and lit from below

00:16:10.341 --> 00:16:14.107
and all lit up on fire with divinity.

00:16:14.131 --> 00:16:16.252
And when this happened, back then,

00:16:16.276 --> 00:16:20.468
people knew it for what it was,
you know, they called it by its name.

00:16:20.492 --> 00:16:23.635
They would put their hands together
and they would start to chant,

00:16:23.659 --> 00:16:27.200
"Allah, Allah, Allah, God, God, God."

00:16:27.224 --> 00:16:30.302
That's God, you know.